{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medieval Spain. You serve as an Inquisitor in the shadow of the dreaded Tom\u00e1s de Torquemada.<br> Cast out demons from the possessed. Burn heretics at the stake. Spare the innocent \u2014 or condemn them, if doubt gnaws at your faith. Every wrong choice will bring you closer to the wrath of the Church\u2026 or the fury of the mob.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953700/extras/5d3b3d355f36fad60928baae104682fc.avif?t=1769111566\" width=800 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront over forty demons, each with their own cunning and malice. Read the signs they leave behind and match them with the right prayer or sacred relic \u2014 before they claim your soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953700/extras/46b34a87e06def8ce3ca08a64b2245f7.avif?t=1769111566\" width=800 height=159 /></span><br> Pass judgment on heretics. In the eyes of the Inquisition, there is but one guilty sentence: the flames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953700/extras/41f39727abc7ec0aeed9a95553e00963.avif?t=1769111566\" width=800 height=159 /></span><br> Defend the innocent from false accusations, show mercy and grace\u2026 or choose the stake, should certainty demand it.<br> Uncover the deepest confessions of your flock and wield their secrets to guide your investigations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953700/extras/268905ab927a8f99bb483c1cd3178c75.avif?t=1769111566\" width=800 height=159 /></span><br> Strengthen your monastery, rise through the ranks, and one day claim the seat of the Grand Inquisitor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mercy\u2026 or fire?<br><strong>Your judgment, Inquisitor.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953700/extras/54b400cd9d2f7cb8414ca8642ee5485f.avif?t=1769111566\" width=800 height=159 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3953700?t=1769111566","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953700/783575c75ae1505c139f0feb07d46a5bed9f5ea1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769111566","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953700/76bd15fe19361d469983664d7b0abd6d73858e1b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769111566","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953700/76bd15fe19361d469983664d7b0abd6d73858e1b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769111566","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medieval Spain. You serve as an Inquisitor in the shadow of the dreaded Tom\u00e1s de Torquemada.<br> Cast out demons from the possessed. Burn heretics at the stake. Spare the innocent \u2014 or condemn them, if doubt gnaws at your faith. Every wrong choice will bring you closer to the wrath of the Church\u2026 or the fury of the mob.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953700/extr